    "date": "2026-09-11T10:41:46Z",
    "text": "Affordable Innovation for the Grid Act\n\nThis bill directs the Department of Energy to assess and report on the use of artificial intelligence and high-performance computing technologies to enhance the capacity, reliable operation, and operational efficiency of the bulk-power system."
